+## Phase 10 production hardening
+
+| ID | Finding | Severity | Resolution/state |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| P10-001 | Production could be started with incomplete external configuration | Critical | Fixed: fail-closed production config and `production:check` gate |
+| P10-002 | API health did not distinguish liveness from database readiness | High | Fixed: `/api/health/live` and `/api/health/ready` with PostgreSQL probe |
+| P10-003 | API process had no coordinated graceful shutdown | High | Fixed: HTTP, Socket.IO, Apollo and Prisma close on SIGTERM/SIGINT |
+| P10-004 | Long-running in-memory rate-limit map could grow without cleanup | Medium | Fixed: bounded periodic expiry cleanup |
+| P10-005 | Responsive E2E auth flow depended on visibility timing | Medium | Fixed: viewport breakpoint selects deterministic mobile/desktop control |
